(3464, '夏休みは小さい子も大人も、ビーチで走り回る人が多いです。', 'During the summer vacation, there are many small children and adults running around on the beach.', 8),
(3464, '社長は今日も会社の中で走り回っています。', 'The president is running around in the company today as usual.', 8),
(3465, '父は安いお茶と高いお茶を当てるのが上手です。', 'My father is good at guessing if tea is cheap or expensive. ', 8),
(3465, '大谷氏は、バットにボールを当てる天才です。', 'Mr. Ohtani is a genius at hitting the ball with the bat.', 8),
