(3484, 'まだ一月ですが、もう夏休みが楽しみです。', 'It''s still January, but I''m looking forward to summer vacation already.', 10),
(3484, '日本酒と生ビールが休日の楽しみです。', 'Sake and draft beer are something I look forward to on my days off.', 10),
