(3487, '近道をすると、花見の場所にすぐに行けますよ。', 'If you take a shortcut, you can go to the cherry blossom viewing venue quickly.', 10),
(3488, 'きっと助かるよ。平気。', 'I''m sure they''ll be fine. It''s okay.', 10),
(3488, '家を出たら、目の前にタクシーがいて、助かった。', 'When I left the house, there was a taxi right in front of my eyes and I was saved.', 10),
