(5357, '旅行から帰ってきた翌日は、何をしていたんですか？', 'What were you doing the day after you returned from your trip?', 30),
(5357, '列車は翌日平常運転にもどりました。', 'The railroad service went back to normal the next day.', 30),
(5357, '大雪の影響でイベントは翌日に延期されました。', 'Due to heavy snowfall, the event was postponed to the following day.', 30),
(5358, '4月に入社し、翌月に研修が始まった。', 'I joined the company in April, and training started the following month', 30),
(5358, '彼はガンで入院し、翌月に退院しました。', 'He was hospitalized due to cancer and was discharged the following month.', 30),
