(3267, 'What works so well? Your special <reading>key</reading> (き) that can unlock anyone and anything''s potential. Imagine putting it into a key slot in someone''s back. Someone who''s a good for nothing can''t-do-anything is now an effective member of society! Go around using your key on other non-effective things and show them that anything is possible!'),
