The Book of <reading>Enoch</reading> (いのち) has passed down your fate and told you how to use your <vocabulary>life</vocabulary>. You must read the book of Enoch and find out what you''re supposed to do.'),
(3274, 'This is a jukugo word, which usually means on''yomi readings from the kanji. If you know the readings of your kanji you''ll know how to read this as well.'),
(3275, 'This is a jukugo word, which usually means on''yomi readings from the kanji. If you know the readings of your kanji you''ll know how to read this as well.'),
