(3529, 'The reading is the same as the one you learned with the kanji, presumably because it''s normally attached onto other numbers to signify how many hundred millions of ____ there are.'),
(3530, 'This is a jukugo word, which usually means on''yomi readings from the kanji. If you know the readings of your kanji you''ll know how to read this as well.'),
