(3772, 'The reading is the same as the kanji it comes from. The ガス is of course "gas."'),
(3773, 'This is a jukugo word, which usually means on''yomi readings from the kanji. If you know the readings of your kanji you''ll know how to read this as well.'),
(3774, 'This is a jukugo word, which usually means on''yomi readings from the kanji. If you know the readings of your kanji you''ll know how to read this as well. The ほう changes to ぽう.'),
