(3778, 'The reading is the same as the one you learned with the kanji. Neko neko neko! Kawaiiiii.'),
(3779, 'The reading is the vocab word 子 (こ) and the reading for cat (ねこ).'),
(3780, 'The reading is the same as the one you learned with the kanji, <reading>あき</reading>.'),
