(4039, 'This is a jukugo word, which usually means on''yomi readings from the kanji. You just have to remember that 伝 is read as でん in this case. Just imagine yourself sitting in your <reading>den</reading> (でん) as you get cozy and listen to this theory about a great <vocabulary>legend</vocabulary>.'),
