'),
(4753, 'The readings for this one are the kun''yomi readings of each kanji. 子 is こ, like the individual vocab word. 供 is ども, however. Remember this by thinking how much <vocabulary>children</vocabulary> love <reading>domo</reading>-kun (ども).

