(4881, '<reading>Yah do</reading> (やど) what you must to get <vocabulary>lodging</vocabulary>s for the night. Whether that''s an <vocabulary>inn</vocabulary> or <vocabulary>hotel</vocabulary> or whatever. <reading>Yah do</reading> what you gotta do.'),
