(4902, 'I''m going to do some <vocabulary>fortune telling</vocabulary> on you... hmmm... I see... ohhhh... Looks like you''ll be living on <reading>Uranu</reading>s (うらな) in your near future, that will be $50. What a dumb fortune telling for $50, you definitely won''t be living there, unless he meant your butt, then maybe.'),
(4903, 'What is it you want <vocabulary>to occupy</vocabulary> most in the whole, entire world? Your own flock of <reading>shee</reading>p (し). Also, a fortune teller (this kanji also means fortune, remember) told you that if you occupy her sheep, you''ll have good luck! Gotta do as she says!'),
