(5051, 'What’s the most <vocabulary>dense</vocabulary> thing you can think of? A <reading>子</reading> (こ). Children are so full of joy, you can practically see how dense, <vocabulary>thick</vocabulary> and <vocabulary>concentrated</vocabulary> the joy is.'),
