(5139, 'The reading is weird on this one, but gambling is weird, I guess. はく goes to ばく, maybe because you''re playing some gambling <reading>back</reading>gammon. The ち can be <reading>chea</reading>ting, where you cheat at this gambling backgammon. So, you''re <reading>back</reading>gammon <reading>chea</reading>ting (ばくち), you big cheater.'),
(5140, 'The reading is the words 星 and 占い put together into one. Did you foresee that one coming?'),
