(5348, 'The reading is 切る cut short to きっ, then ふ rendaku''d to ぷ. It''s a bit of a troublesome word, so concentrate on this now a bit so you can get it in the reviews.'),
(5349, 'This is a jukugo word, which usually means on''yomi readings from the kanji. If you know the readings of your kanji you''ll know how to read this as well. Will help if you''ve seen 一杯 before.'),
