(5496, 'The readings are the ones you learned with the individual kanji. Put them together and you''ll know this is <vocabulary>Tokushima Prefecture</vocabulary>.'),
(5497, 'You are looking for a <reading>sagger</reading> (さが) amongst the products you''re shipping off overseas. The saggers are the boxes that have weird lumps sagging out of them, which means they broke and are getting things wet. So, find the saggers. Go <vocabulary>to search for</vocabulary> them, because they could ruin the whole shipment.'),
