(5648, 'If anyone is going <vocabulary>to live one''s life</vocabulary>, it''s gotta be the great <reading>Ku</reading>blai Khan (く). He conquered most of the world and was super badass.'),
(5649, 'This is a jukugo word that uses the on''yomi readings of the kanji. You should be able to read this on your own.'),
