(5661, 'This is a jukugo word that uses the on''yomi readings of the kanji. You just have to remember that 皇 is read as のう here. You just found out you can never be the Emperor of Japan because you aren''t Japanese. <reading>NOOOOOOOOOOOOO</reading>~ (のう).'),
(5662, 'This is a jukugo word that uses the on''yomi readings of the kanji. You should be able to read this on your own.'),
