(5672, 'So you''re supplying something... let''s say nuclear warheads... to <reading>Osa</reading>ma Bin Laden. You gonna be in soooo much trouble, especially since it''s zombie Osama Bin Laden.'),
(5673, 'This is a jukugo word that uses the on''yomi readings of the kanji. You should be able to read this on your own.'),
