(5675, 'The reading is the same as the one you learned with the kanji. OH <reading>HAI</reading> THERE LUNG. OH HAI THERE YOU.'),
(5676, 'The reading is the same as what you learned with the kanji.'),
(5677, 'This is a jukugo word that uses the on''yomi readings of the kanji. You should be able to read this on your own.'),
(5678, 'Something is so <vocabulary>remarkable</vocabulary> you let out <reading>one jeer</reading> (いちじる) at the opposing team. Just one, because you''re not that mean.'),
(5679, 'This is a jukugo word that uses the on''yomi readings of the kanji. You should be able to read this on your own.'),
(5680, 'This is a jukugo word that uses the on''yomi readings of the kanji. You should be able to read this on your own.'),
(5681, 'What is making things <vocabulary>get hot and sticky</vocabulary>? Not many people know this, but it’s actually all of the cows going <reading>moo</reading> (む). With how much they moo, they create so much steam that everything is turning hot and sticky. Who could’ve known?!'),
(5682, 'This is a jukugo word that uses the on''yomi readings of the kanji. You should be able to read this on your own.'),
(5683, 'The reading is the same as the other storehouse reading you learned earlier with 倉 and 庫. They''re all basically the same thing, and lucky for you they share the same reading too (<reading>くら</reading>).'),
(5684, 'This is a jukugo word that uses the on''yomi readings of the kanji. You should be able to read this on your own.'),
