(5892, 'You did learn the reading of 寿, but the reading for 命 is an exception. When you think of a lifespan, think of how that affects everyone. Me, you... well, just those things. Combine them both into <reading>myou</reading> (みょう). That is who the lifespan affects. Myou!'),
