(5894, 'The readings are the on''yomi reading. You''ve seen the on''yomi reading of 喜 before, though it may be hard to remember at this point. Maybe you can think about how when you reach this <vocabulary>seventy seventh birthday</vocabulary>, all you want is a <reading>key</reading> (き) to the city so you can do whatever you want.'),
(5895, 'This is a jukugo word that uses the on''yomi readings of the kanji. You should be able to read this on your own.'),
