(5899, 'Whenever you do something <vocabulary>embarrassing</vocabulary>, nothing makes it worse than someone pointing and saying, "<reading>Hah</reading> (は)! Look at this loser!" As if you weren''t <vocabulary>ashamed</vocabulary> enough already.'),
(5900, 'This is also the reading you learned. How nice! But if you don''t remember it, what a <vocabulary>shame</vocabulary>. What an <vocabulary>embarrassment</vocabulary> this must be for you.'),
(5901, 'The reading is the same as the one you learned with the kanji. This will be particularly useful for names, as there''s a lot of names with 杉.'),
