(5907, 'Since this word consists of a kanji with hiragana attached, you can bet that it will use the kun''yomi reading. You didn''t learn that reading with this kanji, so here''s a mnemonic to help you: <vocabulary>For the sake of</vocabulary> public safety, you will need to <reading>tame</reading> (ため) the wild beasts loose in our city. Now go, <reading>tame</reading> them!'),
