(5928, 'You need to apply <vocabulary>oil</vocabulary> to <reading>a bra</reading> (あぶら) because it''s stuck on you. You can''t get it unhooked, so you have to slide it off. Problem is, it''s too tight, which is why <reading>a bra</reading> needs oil to slide off.'),
(5929, 'This is a jukugo word that uses the on''yomi readings of the kanji. You should be able to read this on your own.'),
(5930, 'This is a jukugo word, which usually means on''yomi readings from the kanji. You haven''t learned this reading for 田 yet. Just think about how you walk into the <vocabulary>oil field</vocabulary> and you see a bear <reading>den</reading> (でん), filled with oil.'),
(5931, 'This is a jukugo word that uses the on''yomi readings of the kanji. You should be able to read this on your own.'),
