(6027, 'Since this word is made up of a single kanji, it probably uses the kun''yomi reading. You did not learn this reading, so here''s a mnemonic to help you: 

Using your animal <vocabulary>fang</vocabulary> you are able to eat <reading>kibble</reading> (きば).'),
