(6029, 'The reading is the vocab readings from 一人 and 暮らす, so you should be able to read this on your own. Just note that くらし changes to ぐらし due to rendaku.'),
(6030, 'The reading for this is a bit weird, at least for the 彼 portion. Just think about how <vocabulary>she</vocabulary> (your <vocabulary>girlfriend</vocabulary>) is a <reading>canoe</reading> (かの), and you love that canoe girlfriend more than anything. She is your best friend and your lover, and everyone thinks you''re weird. Imagine everyone thinking you''re weird as you give kisses to your canoe girlfriend.'),
(6031, 'The reading is 恥 and 知る put together.'),
