(6137, 'You''re trying <vocabulary>to bury</vocabulary> a <reading>whole moo</reading> (ほうむ) cow outside your home. You can''t just bury parts of it — that would be super disrespectful. To give this thing a proper burial, you have to bury the whole moo cow.'),
