(6461, 'The 破 reading is the one you learned, the 片 reading isn''t one you''ve learned. Just think about how you''re tearing off pieces of a <reading>hen</reading> (へん), one fragment at a time. Here little chicken, I want another feather from you please. *CAW*'),
(6462, 'The reading comes from 御免. The addition is all kana.'),
