(6488, 'From now on, everything is going <vocabulary>to be based on</vocabulary> your <reading>yo</reading>-yo (よ) skills. You want a raise at work? It''s going <vocabulary>to depend on</vocabulary> your yo-yo performance. Your partner left you? Has <vocabulary>to be due to</vocabulary> your yo-yoing failures. Better get used to this new yo-yo meritocracy we''re living in!'),
