(6755, 'The reading comes from the on''yomi for 服 and the kun''yomi for 喪, which you learned with the word 喪. You should know how to read this word!'),
(6756, 'This is a jukugo word that uses the on''yomi readings of the kanji. You should be able to read this on your own.'),
(6757, 'The reading comes from 揚げる as well.'),
(6758, 'The reading comes from 握る, so get a grip on that!'),
