(6844, 'The reading comes from 引く and 裂く.'),
(6845, 'This is a jukugo word that uses the on''yomi readings of the kanji. You should be able to read this on your own.'),
(6846, 'This is a jukugo word that uses the on''yomi readings of the kanji. You should be able to read this on your own.'),
(6847, 'This is a jukugo word that uses the on''yomi readings of the kanji. You should be able to read this on your own.'),
