(7063, 'The reading for 化 is a new reading, け. To remember this, think about someone putting on <vocabulary>makeup</vocabulary>. They finish putting it on, and then you say "<reading>K, show</reading> (けしょう) me!"'),
(7064, 'As a human everyone would know who you are. You can''t deceive anyone like that. But, <reading>as a moo</reading> (あざむ)... a cow is what I mean... nobody would know who you are.'),
