(7099, 'The reading of 雑 is different from what you''ve learned. Instead of ざつ it''s ぞう. Just imagine using this <vocabulary>dust cloth</vocabulary> to wipe down a <reading>象</reading> (ぞう). Its trunk is particularly dusty.'),
