(8808, 'This word uses the kun''yomi readings for both kanji. You learned the kun''yomi reading for 値 in the vocabulary word 値 (ね). You learned the reading for 札 in the vocabulary 札 (ふだ). Put them together and you have ねふだ.'),
(8809, 'If you want <vocabulary>to surpass</vocabulary> everyone, you have to be <reading>su</reading>per <reading>goo</reading>d (すぐ) at stuff. Like, super good at everything. Not pretty good, not really good — <em>super good</em>. Only then can you surpass all the others.'),
